msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:203
#: fdd5865b490e46c0b6f457aeb81f4671
msgid ""
"The solution is to disable hibernation in Windows with this command. (That "
"command is included in QWT’s setup, but it’s necessary to run it manually in "
