#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:291
#: 5cac6ee5b862456d952f31f89d56a0d0
msgid ""
"It is advisable to set some other parameters in order to enable audio and "
"USB block device access, synchronize the Windows clock with the Qubes clock, "
"and so on:"
